WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.630
Roll two dice and add the numbers.

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.210
The smallest total you can get is two.

3
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.310
The biggest is twelve.

4
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.070
That makes eleven possible totals.

5
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.030
So does each total
have the same chance?

6
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.390
Is rolling a seven just as
likely as rolling a twelve?

7
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.970
In this mission, you'll list
every possible outcome in a sample

8
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.200
space grid, so you don't miss any.

9
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.930
You'll sort things into
sets with Venn diagrams,

10
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.850
and spot where two sets overlap.

11
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.790
And you'll find out when you
can add probabilities together.

12
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.590
Your mission: find out whether
every total on two dice is

13
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.210
equally likely.
